 \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_gamewall-sim-180.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 8000, \"highPrice\": 80000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/gamewall-sim-180\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.8mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"800 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}], \"aggregateRating\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateRating\", \"ratingValue\": 4.5, \"reviewCount\": 2, \"bestRating\": 5, \"worstRating\": 1}}14:Tad9,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the main technical features of the GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0 features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, 180\\u00b0 curved wraparound design with three LED panels, 2ms ultra-low response time, and a refresh rate of 144Hz. It delivers 800 nits brightness and supports major simulation software for an immersive experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0 compatible with popular sim racing and flight simulation software?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is fully compatible with leading platforms including iRacing, Assetto Corsa Competizione (ACC), Microsoft Flight Simulator (MSFS), and Digital Combat Simulator (DCS), providing seamless integration for professional and enthusiast setups.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for the GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The system comprises three curved LED panels designed for cockpit wraparound installation. It requires a stable mounting setup with sufficient space to accommodate the 180\\u00b0 curvature for optimal peripheral immersion.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the warranty for the GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0 work?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard warranty covering defects in materials and workmanship. Please contact us for detailed warranty terms and duration to ensure full support for your investment.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0 compare to VR headset alternatives?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike VR headsets, the GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0 provides a wider, wraparound visual field without headset discomfort or motion sickness. Its ultra-fast 2ms response time ensures smooth visuals and eliminates motion blur for real-world simulation comfort.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of environments is the GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0 best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It is ideal for home cinemas, dedicated sim racing setups, flight simulation cockpits, and VR-alternative environments that require immersive wide-field LED display performance with high fidelity and responsiveness.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does brightness and pixel pitch impact viewing experience?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The 800 nits brightness ensures clear visibility even in ambient light conditions, while the 1.8mm pixel pitch provides sharp, detailed images crucial for simulation realism and immersion in close viewing scenarios.\"}}]}9:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$13\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}],\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\"],\"$L18\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"GameWall Sim 180\\\\u00b0\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/gamewall-sim-180\\\"}]}\"}}]\n16:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n17:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n19:T768,<h1>GameWall Sim 180°</h1><p>Immerse in gaming with GameWall Sim 180° LED display in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers custom curved LED walls. Inquire now!</p><p><strong>180° curved LED for sim racing and flight simulation.</strong></p><p>The ultimate sim racing and flight simulation display. Three curved LED panels wrap 180° around your cockpit for complete peripheral vision immersion. Designed specifically for high-end sim rigs, flight simulators, and VR alternative setups. Ultra-low 2ms response time ensures zero motion blur at high speeds. Compatible with all major sim racing software and flight simulation platforms.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What are the main technical features of the GameWall Sim 180°?</h3><p>The GameWall Sim 180° features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, 180° curved wraparound design with three LED panels, 2ms ultra-low response time, and a refresh rate of 144Hz. It delivers 800 nits brightness and supports major simulation software for an immersive experience.</p><h3>Is the GameWall Sim 180° compatible with popular sim racing and flight simulation software?</h3><p>Yes, it is fully compatible with leading platforms including iRacing, Assetto Corsa Competizione (ACC), Microsoft Flight Simulator (MSFS), and Digital Combat Simulator (DCS), providing seamless integration for professional and enthusiast setups.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements for the GameWall Sim 180°?</h3><p>The system comprises three curved LED panels designed for cockpit wraparound installation. It requires a stable mounting setup with sufficient space to accommodate the 180° curvature for optimal peripheral immersion.</p><h3>How does the warranty for the GameWall Sim 180° work?</h3><p>Brightluxx offers a standard warranty covering defects in materials and workmanship. Please contact us for detailed warranty terms and duration to ensure full support for your investment.</p>18:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$19\"}}]\nf:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\nc:null\n11:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"GameWall Sim 180° LED Display | Immersive Gaming Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Immerse in gaming with GameWall Sim 180° LED display in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers custom curved LED walls. Inquire now!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/gamewall-sim-180\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:T694,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0\", \"description\": \"The ultimate sim racing and flight simulation display. Three curved LED panels wrap 180\\u00b0 around your cockpit for complete p