sh rate of 144Hz. It delivers 800 nits brightness and supports major simulation software for an immersive experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0 compatible with popular sim racing and flight simulation software?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is fully compatible with leading platforms including iRacing, Assetto Corsa Competizione (ACC), Microsoft Flight Simulator (MSFS), and Digital Combat Simulator (DCS), providing seamless integration for professional and enthusiast setups.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for the GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The system comprises three curved LED panels designed for cockpit wraparound installation. It requires a stable mounting setup with sufficient space to accommodate the 180\\u00b0 curvature for optimal peripheral immersion.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the warranty for the GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0 work?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard warranty covering defects in materials and workmanship. Please contact us for detailed warranty terms and duration to ensure full support for your investment.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0 compare to VR headset alternatives?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike VR headsets, the GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0 provides a wider, wraparound visual field without headset discomfort or motion sickness. Its ultra-fast 2ms response time ensures smooth visuals and eliminates motion blur for real-world simulation comfort.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of environments is the GameWall Sim 180\\u00b0 best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It is ideal for home cinemas, dedicated sim racing setups, flight simulation cockpits, and VR-alternative environments that require immersive wide-field LED display performance with high fidelity and responsiveness.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does brightness and pixel pitch impact viewing experience?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The 800 nits brightness ensures clear visibility even in ambient light conditions, while the 1.8mm pixel pitch provides sharp, detailed images crucial for simulation realism and immersion in close viewing scenarios.\"}}]}a:X\nf:X\nf:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"OyzTyuj62-glU9gwZiKSa\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$3\"}}],\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\"],\"$L7\"]}],null,\"$L8\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@9\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Lb\",\"isPartial\":\"$@c\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Ld\",\"isPartial\":\"$@e\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":\"$f\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L10\",\"isPartial\":\"$@11\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@12\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@13\"}\n15:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n16:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n18:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n19:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n1a:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\"]\n1b:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\"]\n1c:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n1d:I[48303,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"SiteHeader\"]\n1e:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7