n/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:T768,<h1>GameWall Sim 180°</h1><p>Immerse in gaming with GameWall Sim 180° LED display in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers custom curved LED walls. Inquire now!</p><p><strong>180° curved LED for sim racing and flight simulation.</strong></p><p>The ultimate sim racing and flight simulation display. Three curved LED panels wrap 180° around your cockpit for complete peripheral vision immersion. Designed specifically for high-end sim rigs, flight simulators, and VR alternative setups. Ultra-low 2ms response time ensures zero motion blur at high speeds. Compatible with all major sim racing software and flight simulation platforms.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What are the main technical features of the GameWall Sim 180°?</h3><p>The GameWall Sim 180° features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, 180° curved wraparound design with three LED panels, 2ms ultra-low response time, and a refresh rate of 144Hz. It delivers 800 nits brightness and supports major simulation software for an immersive experience.</p><h3>Is the GameWall Sim 180° compatible with popular sim racing and flight simulation software?</h3><p>Yes, it is fully compatible with leading platforms including iRacing, Assetto Corsa Competizione (ACC), Microsoft Flight Simulator (MSFS), and Digital Combat Simulator (DCS), providing seamless integration for professional and enthusiast setups.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements for the GameWall Sim 180°?</h3><p>The system comprises three curved LED panels designed for cockpit wraparound installation. It requires a stable mounting setup with sufficient space to accommodate the 180° curvature for optimal peripheral immersion.</p><h3>How does the warranty for the GameWall Sim 180° work?</h3><p>Brightluxx offers a standard warranty covering defects in materials and workmanship. Please contact us for detailed warranty terms and duration to ensure full support for your investment.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"GameWall Sim 180° LED Display | Immersive Gaming Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Immerse in gaming with GameWall Sim 180° LED display in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers custom curved LED walls. Inquire now!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\"